WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.475 --> 00:00:07.889
- It was a sad sad day when the countess

00:00:07.889 --> 00:00:09.615
finally kicked the bucket.

00:00:09.615 --> 00:00:11.624
But the wealthy woman left a will.

00:00:11.624 --> 00:00:13.608
In her will she left all her money

00:00:13.608 --> 00:00:15.236
to her three grandchildren.

00:00:15.236 --> 00:00:18.609
Despite the fact that they
were kinda spoiled brats.

00:00:18.609 --> 00:00:20.581
The last line of the will stated that she

00:00:20.581 --> 00:00:23.628
had one final thing to give away, a ruby,

00:00:23.628 --> 00:00:25.804
the size of a gosh darn walnut.

00:00:25.804 --> 00:00:29.654
Holy hoo-haw, I want that
walnut, said the oldest.

00:00:29.654 --> 00:00:32.372
However, the old woman only gave one clue

00:00:32.372 --> 00:00:34.825
as to where that juicy
ruby might be located.

00:00:34.825 --> 00:00:36.758
The ruby lies in a cylinder,

00:00:36.758 --> 00:00:40.131
surrounded by a thousand squares.

00:00:40.131 --> 00:00:43.343
After a long period of
intense and fruitless thought,

00:00:43.343 --> 00:00:47.441
the youngest grandchild
said, I know where it is.

00:00:47.441 --> 00:00:48.798
She ran off and two minutes later

00:00:48.798 --> 00:00:50.877
returned with that juicy ruby.

00:00:50.877 --> 00:00:52.544
Where was it hidden?

00:00:54.069 --> 00:00:56.526
- The (bleep) (laughter).

00:00:56.526 --> 00:00:58.067
- I don't know.

00:00:58.067 --> 00:01:01.438
- First of all, why is grandma
leaving riddles in her will?

00:01:01.438 --> 00:01:03.470
Ain't nobody got time for this.

00:01:03.470 --> 00:01:05.386
- This is really doin' my head in.

00:01:05.386 --> 00:01:07.533
- Do I get more clues, no?

00:01:07.533 --> 00:01:09.475
- Can't be her grave, it can't be--

00:01:09.475 --> 00:01:12.364
- What is this again (laughs)?

00:01:12.364 --> 00:01:13.691
- Maybe it's like a haunted house,

00:01:13.691 --> 00:01:15.021
maybe it's like in a
fun house or something.

00:01:15.021 --> 00:01:16.783
Now I'm goin' all over the place.

00:01:16.783 --> 00:01:18.200
- A taleidoscope?

00:01:19.150 --> 00:01:20.198
Okay.

00:01:20.198 --> 00:01:22.947
- It's square, are you
talking about how they'll

00:01:22.947 --> 00:01:25.190
call people squares, like they're not hip.

00:01:25.190 --> 00:01:27.588
- Inside a television, inside her house.

00:01:27.588 --> 00:01:30.690
- I don't know, I have
no idea, yeah I give up.

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:32.169
- [Voiceover] So where was the ruby?

00:01:32.169 --> 00:01:34.311
It was hidden in a roll of toilet paper.

00:01:34.311 --> 00:01:37.707
A cylinder surrounded
by a thousand squares.

00:01:37.707 --> 00:01:39.791
Give or take a few.

00:01:39.791 --> 00:01:43.124
- Oh my God, I'm so angry, I'm so angry.

00:01:44.656 --> 00:01:48.825
- This is what I was
thinking, uhh, this sucks!

00:01:48.825 --> 00:01:52.640
- It's gonna be something
really simple, isn't it?

00:01:52.640 --> 00:01:54.557
- Are you (bleep) serious?

00:01:54.557 --> 00:01:55.714
What the (bleep) is this?

00:01:55.714 --> 00:01:59.131
Are you...oh my God, a thousand mm, okay.

